   "text": "The C1 exam asks you to **rewrite** a text for another reader (*μετασχηματισμός* 'transformation'): a friendly email becomes a formal letter, a news item becomes a chat. Educated Greeks do this constantly, and the switch is mostly lexical: a few dozen everyday verbs each have a learned partner. Learn them as **pairs**, so either one calls up the other."
